298
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:49,720
I haven't finished my homework yet.

299
00:15:58,960 --> 00:15:59,799
It won't open.

300
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:03,080
Let me have a look.

301
00:16:05,159 --> 00:16:06,080
It's okay.

302
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,279
It's an old model anyway.

303
00:16:07,559 --> 00:16:08,440
If it's broken, so be it.

304
00:16:08,879 --> 00:16:10,159
This was a gift from my mom.

305
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,399
I was thinking...

306
00:16:11,759 --> 00:16:13,080
It's really fine.

307
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,080
I have plenty of gaming consoles.

308
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,320
I don't need this one.

309
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,480
Let's go, hurry up and run.

310
00:16:32,559 --> 00:16:33,879
This morning,

311
00:16:33,879 --> 00:16:35,360
we'll do a symbiosis training.

312
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,080
Symbiosis training.

313
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:40,480
You need to work in pairs,

314
00:16:40,559 --> 00:16:41,639
back to back with a ball,

315
00:16:41,639 --> 00:16:44,000
and cooperate to carry the ball to the baseline.

316
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:50,200
Lin Qingyuan,

317
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:51,080
can you slow down a bit?

318
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:52,320
You're going too fast.

319
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,840
Keep going, don't stop.

320
00:16:58,679 --> 00:17:00,039
Lower your center of gravity a bit.

321
00:17:00,039 --> 00:17:01,399
You're always pushing me.

322
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:06,640
Let's start over.

323
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:13,440
Slow down.

324
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:13,960
Hold steady.

325
00:17:25,759 --> 00:17:26,839
Coach, we're here.

326
00:17:27,559 --> 00:17:28,480
Get ready to shoot.

327
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,559
One person shoots,

328
00:17:30,559 --> 00:17:31,720
the other gives directions.

329
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,480
Follow my lead.

330
00:17:34,319 --> 00:17:34,839
Okay.

331
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,039
This drill tests

332
00:17:37,039 --> 00:17:38,599
your communication

333
00:17:38,599 --> 00:17:39,960
and trust.

334
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:40,960
A bit more to the right.

335
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:41,960
To the left, to the left.

336
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,039
Downwards.

337
00:17:43,039 --> 00:17:43,400
Can we throw now?

338
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:43,920
Too high.

339
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,799
A bit lower.

340
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:45,759
To the left, to the left.

341
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:46,759
A bit more...

342
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:48,640
How did you do?

343
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,440
Zero points.

344
00:17:53,079 --> 00:17:53,759
Next group.

345
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:54,880
It's too difficult.

346
00:17:55,359 --> 00:17:55,720
Yeah.

347
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,160
It's impossible.

348
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,319
Your turn.

349
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,279
Let's go.

350
00:18:03,079 --> 00:18:03,880
Li Haoyu,

351
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,759
why are you so absent-minded?

352
00:18:07,039 --> 00:18:07,839
No.

353
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,160
Let's go.

354
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:13,599
What's wrong with your foot?

355
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:15,640
Nothing, just sprained it a bit.

356
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:16,400
It's fine.

357
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,480
Excuse me,

358
00:18:23,799 --> 00:18:25,480
is this the Yibei Basketball Team?

359
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:27,799
Yes.

360
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,319
And you two are...?

361
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:32,200
Lin and Ye.

362
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:37,519
Yuan.

363
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:39,119
Mom also prepared sunscreen for you.

364
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:41,279
Be sure to use it during outdoor training.

365
00:18:41,799 --> 00:18:42,400
Alright.

366
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:43,160
We just happened to pass by

367
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:43,960
to take a look.

368
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,200
Gotta go fishing now.

369
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:45,759
Yuan.

370
00:18:45,759 --> 00:18:47,519
Train well, be happy every day.

371
00:18:48,519 --> 00:18:48,960
By the way,

372
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,559
I still have something here.

373
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,759
Here we go again with this trick.

374
00:18:54,799 --> 00:18:55,759
Cheer up, cheer up.

375
00:18:56,359 --> 00:18:57,000
We're off.

376
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:58,559
Brother Lin, Sister Ye.

377
00:18:58,559 --> 00:18:59,559
Good luck fishing.

378
00:18:59,839 --> 00:19:01,480
Wish you a big harvest.

379
00:19:01,839 --> 00:19:02,559
Okay.

380
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:05,559
Let's go, son.

381
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:06,039
Okay.

382
00:19:06,039 --> 00:19:06,640
Bye.

383
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:08,119
Brother Lin, drive slowly.

384
00:19:08,119 --> 00:19:08,960
Okay.

385
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:14,079
Your parents are really good to you.

386
00:19:14,079 --> 00:19:15,839
They even thought of bringing you something.

387
00:19:16,279 --> 00:19:17,160
Of course.

388
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,480
Lin and Ye

389
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:19,759
are like my friends.

390
00:19:19,759 --> 00:19:21,400
Our family's motto is

391
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,160
happiness is the most important.

392
00:19:25,799 --> 00:19:27,480
They just let you do whatever you want?

393
00:19:27,759 --> 00:19:28,440
Yeah.

394
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,480
As long as I'm happy,

395
00:19:30,799 --> 00:19:32,119
they'll support me in everything.

396
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,160
Unlike some people,

397
00:19:34,559 --> 00:19:36,240
who just knows how to recite scriptures.

398
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,119
Xu Anbo.

399
00:19:37,119 --> 00:19:38,480
Let's go eat over there.

400
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,119
Let's go.

401
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,279
Together?

402
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,160
Let's go.

403
00:20:01,079 --> 00:20:01,839
Thank you.

404
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,279
Is Li Haoyu

405
00:20:08,279 --> 00:20:09,119
still like this?

406
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,680
He doesn't tell me.

407
00:20:14,519 --> 00:20:15,599
I don't know what to do.

408
00:20:16,839 --> 00:20:18,039
He's always been like this.

409
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:20,680
The more you ask, the more he tries to hide it.

410
00:20:22,599 --> 00:20:23,839
Just leave him be.

411
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:31,400
I'm working on Lin Qingyuan's new plan.

412
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:33,880
His shortcomings?

413
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:37,440
Easily distracted, lacks persistence.

414
00:20:38,319 --> 00:20:40,039
That's quite accurate.

415
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:43,759
Meeting his parents today,

416
00:20:43,759 --> 00:20:44,720
I realized

417
00:20:45,119 --> 00:20:46,079
he must have been

418
00:20:46,079 --> 00:20:47,839
raised with constant encouragement.

419
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,400
Instead of trying to change him,

420
00:20:49,799 --> 00:20:51,440
we should just cater to his interests.

421
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:52,400
Right?

422
00:20:53,359 --> 00:20:54,640
You're going to encourage him too?

423
00:20:56,559 --> 00:20:57,720
I hope this

424
00:20:58,039 --> 00:20:59,640
will keep him motivated.

425
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:02,240
Don't worry too much.

426
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,079
Lin Qingyuan may seem

427
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:04,200
carefree,

428
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,079
but sometimes he's actually

429
00:21:05,079 --> 00:21:06,440
quite focused.

430
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,160
What's the use of temporary focus?

431
00:21:11,359 --> 00:21:11,839
I feel like

432
00:21:11,839 --> 00:21:13,079
I'm talking to a teacher.

433
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:14,240
Am I?

434
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,720
Insect.

435
00:21:24,519 --> 00:21:25,319
Stay away from me.

436
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:26,880
Throw it away.

437
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:27,920
Wait.

438
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:31,359
What? You like it?

439
00:21:31,799 --> 00:21:32,960
It's called Onthophagus suturalis.

440
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:34,640
Look at the pattern on its back.

441
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:35,519
It's pretty.

442
00:21:36,119 --> 00:21:37,319
You know this?

443
00:21:37,319 --> 00:21:38,319
I know a little.

444
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:41,160
More than a little, I think.

445
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,400
What a person

446
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,640
and what he likes.

447
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,359
Do you have a problem?

448
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:48,640
- No. - Take it away.

449
00:21:57,559 --> 00:21:58,240
It doesn't

450
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,640
look like it likes you very much.

451
00:22:04,039 --> 00:22:05,319
Go back to training after eating.

452
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:11,039
Zhou Yang,

453
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:12,599
there are so many delicious foods.

454
00:22:12,599 --> 00:22:13,720
Eat with us.

455
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:15,240
Come on, take off your shoes.

456
00:22:15,359 --> 00:22:16,240
Fine.

457
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:17,519
Eat together.

458
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:10,680
Hello, Dr. Qin.

459
00:23:11,200 --> 00:23:12,039
Fu Binian,

460
00:23:12,480 --> 00:23:14,039
your recovery

461
00:23:14,039 --> 00:23:15,119
is better than expected.

462
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:17,000
[You should be able to]

463
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:17,799
[do daily exercise.]

464
00:23:18,559 --> 00:23:19,319
[Keep it up.]

465
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,160
Thank you, Dr. Qin.

466
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:24,640
I'll keep working hard.

467
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:27,680
Goodbye.

468
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,319
Nice shot!

469
00:24:15,799 --> 00:24:16,839
Zhou Yang said you're good

470
00:24:16,839 --> 00:24:17,799
at basketball.

471
00:24:18,319 --> 00:24:20,200
But I didn't believe it until now.

472
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:24,240
I haven't played for a long time.

473
00:24:24,759 --> 00:24:26,400
I'd like to ask you for advice.

474
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,440
About what?

475
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:30,880
Some training plans.

476
00:24:46,119 --> 00:24:48,680
Did you make all of these?

477
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:51,839
I'm the captain.

478
00:24:52,079 --> 00:24:53,000
I know them

479
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:54,200
better than the coach.

480
00:24:54,599 --> 00:24:55,640
Actually, Lin Qingyuan

481
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:56,720
is a bit troublesome.

482
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:58,160
The others are fine.

483
00:25:01,960 --> 00:25:02,720
What?

484
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:04,319
Is there a problem?

485
00:25:06,319 --> 00:25:07,039
Nothing.

486
00:25:07,799 --> 00:25:09,839
I'm just relieved for Zhou Yang.

487
00:25:11,759 --> 00:25:12,880
What do you mean?

488
00:25:15,559 --> 00:25:16,279
How about this?

489
00:25:16,799 --> 00:25:18,279
I'll give you a training plan.

490
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:20,039
What plan?

491
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:49,640
Today's training is simple.

492
00:25:50,160 --> 00:25:50,880
Running up the mountain.

493
00:25:52,559 --> 00:25:53,440
Running up the mountain?

494
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,519
Simple?

495
00:25:56,079 --> 00:25:57,160
How can this be simple?

496
00:25:57,519 --> 00:25:58,839
Just run up, right?

497
00:26:01,039 --> 00:26:02,319
If we start this late,

498
00:26:02,319 --> 00:26:03,799
we'll be up there after dark!

499
00:26:04,119 --> 00:26:05,279
Then it all depends

500
00:26:05,279 --> 00:26:06,839
on how fast you can run.

501
00:26:07,119 --> 00:26:08,920
Today's goal is simple:

502
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:10,200
beat the sunset.

503
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:11,200
You must reach the viewing platform

504
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:13,079
before dark.

505
00:26:14,599 --> 00:26:15,279
Over.

506
00:26:16,119 --> 00:26:17,319
I'm not done yet.

507
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,920
Today is not a team race,

508
00:26:20,119 --> 00:26:21,799
but an individual orienteering.

509
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:23,920
Here's the map.

510
00:26:25,119 --> 00:26:25,400
Thank you, coach.

511
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:27,559
Warm up well before you set off.

512
00:26:27,559 --> 00:26:28,200
Thank you, coach.

513
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:30,920
The sun is strong up there, so be sure to apply sunscreen.

514
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:31,640
Don't get sunburned.

515
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:33,000
Thank you, coach.

516
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:33,799
Remember to turn on

517
00:26:33,799 --> 00:26:34,880
the location-sharing app.

518
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:36,920
Make sure you understand your own route.

519
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:37,839
Keep an eye on each other.

520
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,319
Don't let anyone fall behind.

521
00:26:39,480 --> 00:26:39,880
Thank you.

522
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:40,880
Thank you.

523
00:26:41,240 --> 00:26:42,079
Alright, alright.

524
00:26:42,079 --> 00:26:42,839
Don't dawdle.

525
00:26:42,839 --> 00:26:44,319
It'll be dark soon.

526
00:26:44,319 --> 00:26:45,200
Let's go.

527
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:46,039
Okay.

528
00:26:54,279 --> 00:26:55,200
Each map

529
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:56,039
has a different route.

530
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,000
Some are difficult, some are easy.

531
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,720
All are tailored for you.

532
00:26:59,039 --> 00:26:59,839
Remember,

533
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,400
individual orienteering

534
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:02,640
is not about who is the best,

535
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:04,240
but the overall result of the team.

536
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:05,559
As long as one person

537
00:27:05,559 --> 00:27:06,440
doesn't arrive on time,

538
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:08,000
the whole team will have extra training tonight.
